        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we had 175 full-time employees, 116 of whom are in research and development, 15 of whom are in sales and marketing and 44 of whom are in finance, legal, business development and administration.",
        "start_character": 85100,
        "end_character": 85318
      },
      {
