        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have retained control of all worldwide manufacturing, marketing, and distribution rights for YARTEMLEA and each of our product candidates and programs, with the exception of our MASP-3 inhibitor program following the sale and license to Novo Nordisk of assets and development rights related to zaltenibart and certain related compounds and products.",
